Snowflake Storage Billing — Complete Guide

Detailed Summary
How Storage is Billed
Snowflake calculates storage costs monthly based on the average number of on-disk bytes stored each day in your Snowflake account.

Two Areas That Contribute to Storage Costs
1. Database Table Data
All three stages of the data lifecycle contribute to billing:
